  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -IR verb; the non-reflexive \"rendir\" means to yield/to produce/to render",
    "e→i stem change in Presente (all forms except nosotros): rindo, rindes, rinde, rinden",
    "In Pretérito Indefinido, e→i in él/ella/usted (rindió) and ellos/ellas/ustedes (rindieron)",
    "Same e→i change in gerund: rindiéndose",
    "Past participle: rendido",
    "Common expressions: \"¡No me rindo!\" = I won't give up!; rendirse ante el enemigo = to surrender to the enemy"
  ],
